<!-- ============ 01 METHOD ============ -->
<section id="method">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="sec-tag rv"><b>01</b><span class="dot"></span>Method</div>
      <div class="anchor third"></div>
      <h2 class="rv">Four steps. The <em>same</em> order for every brand.</h2>
      <p class="ar rv" lang="ar">مفيش محتوى بيتكتب قبل ما الصورة كلها تبقى واضحة.</p>
    </div>

    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="step rv">
        <div class="step-n">01</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Brand Analysis</h3>
          <p class="en">I read the brand as it is today: what it sells, who it talks to, and how it looks and sounds.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="ar" lang="ar">بفهم البراند زي ما هو دلوقتي: بيبيع إيه، بيكلم مين، وشكله وصوته عاملين إزاي.</p>
        <div class="out"><span>Output</span>Brand snapshot</div>
      </li>

      <li class="step rv">
        <div class="step-n">02</div>
        <div>
          <h3>SWOT Analysis</h3>
          <p class="en">Strengths, weaknesses, opportunities and threats. All four on one page, so the plan starts from facts.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="ar" lang="ar">نقط القوة والضعف، والفرص والمخاطر. الأربعة في صفحة واحدة عشان الخطة تبدأ من حقايق.</p>
        <div class="out"><span>Output</span>SWOT sheet</div>
        <div class="swot" aria-label="SWOT grid">
          <div><b>S</b><strong>Strengths</strong><span>What the brand already does well.</span></div>
          <div><b>W</b><strong>Weaknesses</strong><span>What holds it back from inside.</span></div>
          <div><b>O</b><strong>Opportunities</strong><span>Gaps in the market it can take.</span></div>
          <div><b>T</b><strong>Threats</strong><span>Risks and limits from outside.</span></div>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="step rv">
        <div class="step-n">03</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Market Study</h3>
          <p class="en">I study the market and the competitors to find how this product or service can really sell.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="ar" lang="ar">بدرس السوق والمنافسين عشان أعرف المنتج أو الخدمة هتتباع إزاي.</p>
        <div class="out"><span>Output</span>Selling angle</div>
      </li>

      <li class="step rv">
        <div class="step-n">04</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Content Creation</h3>
          <p class="en">Only now I build the content: pillars, a calendar, hooks, posts, carousels and reel scripts.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="ar" lang="ar">دلوقتي بس ببني المحتوى: الأعمدة، الخطة، الهوكات، البوستات والريلز.</p>
        <div class="out"><span>Output</span>Content plan</div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

