          <div><dt>Result</dt><dd>Website <strong>live</strong>, with one clear message across posts and pages.</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p class="ar" lang="ar">فكرة واحدة ماشية في البوست والموقع.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="case rv" style="--d:160ms">
        <p class="case-meta">Cafés · Egypt &amp; Saudi Arabia</p>
        <h3>Testing the message, not guessing it.</h3>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>What I did</dt><dd>Found <strong>291 leads</strong> and tested three ways to open the conversation.</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Result</dt><dd>Best message: <strong>16% reply rate</strong>. Weakest: 4%. Now I know which one works.</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p class="ar" lang="ar">الرسالة بتتجرّب بالأرقام، مش بالتخمين.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

